evidence.text:
Not everything useful costs money.  

http://Fathom.ai records and summarizes meetings.
@GammaApp turns text into presentations.
@ideogram_ai generates images. 
http://Saner.AI manages tasks and notes in one place.  

All have free options. All worth trying.

If you've ever wanted to make a #roblox game, now's your chance.

 @Roblox  just gave 132 million daily active users the ability to build a game from their phone.

Type a prompt. Get a playable game. No coding. No Studio. No experience needed.
